      "source": "<a href=\"AuditableBeanWrapperFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.auditing\"><code>AuditableBeanWrapperFactory</code></a> that will create am <a href=\"AuditableBeanWrapper.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.auditing\"><code>AuditableBeanWrapper</code></a> using mapping information\nobtained from a <a href=\"../mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a> to detect auditing configuration and eventually invoking setting the auditing\nvalues.",
